node_modules/**

# Build artifacts must never ride along inside the extension. vsce excludes
# *.vsix on its own but nothing else, so a stray archive in this directory is
# packaged as extension content: 1.37.0 first built at 212 KB, of which 105 KB
# was a glyph-compress-1.36.5.zip sitting next to the source. Shipping a
# previous build inside the current one is how 1.36.4 went wrong, in a
# different costume.
*.zip
*.vsix
*.tgz
